href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S\\)</span>（分裂点谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ecbf926ec18d5a6f\" href=\"?note=ecbf926ec18d5a6f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S(t,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S(t,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完美子树要求每个节点在子树内部都有两个不可比较的真延伸。</li>\n<li>分裂必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中验证，而不能只在环境树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md","status":"resolved","id":"ecbf926ec18d5a6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"336078cd2c28561e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S$（子树谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md","status":"resolved","id":"ecbf926ec18d5a6f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S$（分裂点谓词，见 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree10-splitting-node.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SplittingNode}_S(t,S)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ab8bcd7b57a9c4e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3770","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","336078cd2c28561e","ecbf9